    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE PROLOGUE</h1><p><i>Demo is unavailable atm as I'm working on something new and exciting.</i><br>Wishlist the prologue which will include a lot more content than the demo!<br><br><br>Buy the original game (owners will get a major discount)!<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a candy factory to defend against waves of candy creatures!<br>A first-person tower defense factory building automation game.<br>Manage productions, build candy turrets, expand the island, and beat the waves!</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Build candy turrets to beat waves of candy creatures</strong> to expand your factory!<br></li><li><strong>Automate with conveyor belts</strong> to produce candies for turrets!<br></li><li><strong>Expand the island</strong> by buying new cells to discover new biomes and resources!<br></li><li><strong>Follow a tech tree</strong> to unlock new exciting turrets and production recipes!<br></li><li><strong>Travel in style</strong> with jump pads, glider, factory boots, and jetpacks!<br></li><li><strong>Immersive first-person</strong> perspective factory building!<br></li><li><strong>Customize the color</strong> of your factory!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a candy factory to defend against waves of candy creatures!<br>A first-person tower defense factory building automation game.<br>Manage productions, build candy turrets, expand the island, and beat the waves!</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Build candy turrets to beat waves of candy creatures</strong> to expand your factory!<br></li><li><strong>Automate with conveyor belts</strong> to produce candies for turrets!<br></li><li><strong>Expand the island</strong> by buying new cells to discover new biomes and resources!<br></li><li><strong>Follow a tech tree</strong> to unlock new exciting turrets and production recipes!<br></li><li><strong>Travel in style</strong> with jump pads, glider, factory boots, and jetpacks!<br></li><li><strong>Immersive first-person</strong> perspective factory building!<br></li><li><strong>Customize the color</strong> of your factory!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Build a candy factory to defend against waves of candy creatures! A first-person tower defense factory building automation game. Manage productions, build candy turrets, expand the island, and beat the waves!",
